OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FHeat
OL,6,Fpeaking on Wednesday and Thursday with
OL,7,Ffurther strong sunshine. Cloud and
OL,8,Fpatchy outbreaks of rain then
OL,9,Ferratically arriving to end the week,
OL,10,Fmainly affecting northern counties.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
